WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.378
Worker 755 a

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:03.144
browser game

00:00:03.678 --> 00:00:04.833
In this open-source

00:00:04.645 --> 00:00:05.564
game a real

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.968
LLM manager assigns

00:00:06.779 --> 00:00:07.852
you shell tasks

00:00:07.664 --> 00:00:08.795
with a 90-second

00:00:08.607 --> 00:00:09.173
clock

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:10.800
reviews your transcript

00:00:10.978 --> 00:00:12.557
files incident reports

00:00:12.381 --> 00:00:13.336
and writes your

00:00:13.147 --> 00:00:14.326
performance review

00:00:14.854 --> 00:00:15.938
The manager is

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:16.646
set up like

00:00:16.646 --> 00:00:18.002
any agent orchestrator

00:00:18.003 --> 00:00:18.816
with a task

00:00:18.628 --> 00:00:19.122
queue

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:20.809
read-only machine access

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.953
and a spawn-subagent

00:00:21.764 --> 00:00:22.259
tool

00:00:22.448 --> 00:00:23.745
except the subagent

00:00:23.651 --> 00:00:24.535
is the player

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:26.119
A browser game

00:00:25.931 --> 00:00:26.827
where your manager

00:00:26.638 --> 00:00:27.404
is an AI

00:00:27.216 --> 00:00:27.900
agent

00:00:27.971 --> 00:00:28.961
and it believes

00:00:28.773 --> 00:00:29.350
you are its

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:30.046
subagent

